# System - all-users Start-menu default fragment. Migrated verbatim from the
# old hardcoded startmenu_init(). Merges the old "System" + "System Tools".
category: System
item: Settings | /APPS/SETTINGS | icon=cog
item: Font Book | /APPS/FONTBOOK | icon=fontbook
item: Network | /APPS/network | icon=network
item: Task Manager | /APPS/taskmgr | icon=task
item: System Monitor | /APPS/SYSMON | icon=sysmon
item: Services | /APPS/SVCMGR | icon=services
item: Device Manager | /APPS/DEVMGR | icon=computer
# #739: mount/eject CD and floppy IMAGES. icon=computer is reused rather than
# a new icon added: icon files live outside the repo in the asset base, so a
# new id would silently fall back to a vector glyph on the real image.
item: Disk Images | /APPS/DISKIMG | icon=computer
item: Install MayteraOS to Disk | /APPS/INSTALL | icon=computer
item: App Repo | /APPS/APPSTORE | icon=appstore
item: System Log | /APPS/SYSLOG | icon=log
item: 3D Print | /APPS/PRINT3D | icon=print3d
item: Recycle Bin | @RECYCLE | icon=trash
